	(text "ECEN 5613 Final Project: 8051 MIDI control surface for Reaper (Hardware_Map.md Rev 13.4)\nAuthors: Nathan Cohen and Travis Nagle.  One sheet per board section; nets join across sheets by global label."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "b879ed09-b306-5d26-a96b-d442b618ae88")
	)
	(text "Inter-board connections:\nJ20 (class) <-> J30 (D-pad)   12-pin ribbon, about 9 in: AD0-AD7, LCD_RS, LCD_RW, LCD_E, GND\nJ21 (class) <-> J31 (D-pad)   10-pin ribbon, about 8 in: +5V, GND x2, BTN_OE_N, TOUCH2, ADC SPI, 1 spare\nJ22 (class) --> FDR1, FDR2 motors   4 wires (two twisted pairs)\nJ32 (D-pad) <-> J40 (fader strip)   6 wires: +5V, GND, BTN_F1, BTN_F2, TOUCH1, TOUCH2\nJ33 (D-pad) --> LCD1   14 wires;  J34 (D-pad) --> FDR1/FDR2 pots   4 wires;  J35 (D-pad) --> J13 pedal jack   3 wires\nJ41 (fader strip) --> FDR1/FDR2 touch pins T   2 wires\nJ11 (class) RJ45 --> J101 (button daughter) patch cable;  J102 --> next daughter board\nPower: J1 (class) <-- 9 V >= 2 A adapter.  USB-C to the KB2040 (A2).  DB9 J5 / J7 TTL debug to the PC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 172.72 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "20e810ef-ffc8-52a6-8ce4-53f574d77de4")
	)
